every vertex on a triangle, some link a cycle of length \[GreaterEqual] 4 (a \
surface)\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"f7672db8-f54f-4552-ac00-ed79813bfe05"], 
    Cell[TextData[StyleBox[
    "{v : lk(v) is not a cycle}", "TI"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
